# Five spheres in a row receding from the camera, focused on the middle
# one through a wide aperture, so the near and far ones blur.
camera aspect 2 1
camera lookfrom 3 1.5 4
camera lookat 0 0.5 -2
camera vfov 35
camera defocus 4
camera focus 5.9

material floor lambertian 0.4 0.45 0.5
material red   lambertian 0.7 0.15 0.1
material clear dielectric 1.33
material steel metal 0.75 0.75 0.8 0.05
material brass metal 0.7 0.55 0.25 0.4

sphere 0 -1000 0 1000 floor
sphere 0 0.5  1.0 0.5 red
sphere 0 0.5 -1.0 0.5 clear
sphere 0 0.5 -3.0 0.5 steel
sphere 0 0.5 -5.0 0.5 brass
sphere 0 0.5 -7.0 0.5 red
